Chapter: Tool Kit

Section: Policy

 Lengths in centimetres, powers in hundredths. Key 0 is the shovel's dig step,
 half of raise ground's 1 m. Keys 1 and 2 are the hoe's smooth radius and
 falloff power: level ground uses 300 and 100, and a higher power flattens
 less away from the centre. Key 3 is the hoe's clear radius.

  tool-kit-setting : Integer -> Integer
  tool-kit-setting (key) =
    if key == 0 then 50
    else if key == 1 then 150
    else if key == 2 then 300
    else if key == 3 then 150
    else 0
